# pip vendor CVEs — pip 26.2.1 (latest) bundles msgpack 1.1.2 and setuptools 70.3.0
# in pip/_vendor/ as private internal copies (importable only via pip._vendor.*, not
# by user code). The user-facing packages are at patched versions (msgpack 1.2.2,
# setuptools 84.0.0). Remove once pip ships updated vendor deps.
GHSA-6v7p-g79w-8964
CVE-2025-47273

# pip vendor CVEs — pip 26.2.1 (latest, and pip main) bundles urllib3 2.7.0 in
# pip/_vendor/. Nothing else in the image installs urllib3 (ansible-core doesn't
# depend on it). Remove once pip ships urllib3 >= 2.8.0.
CVE-2026-97687
